[T-385] ANALYSIS — Autumn Leaves type key investigation (commit aca8de9)

DIAGNOSIS: The task description's typeKey=28 hypothesis was a misidentification.
At offset 0x1A0 in the binary:
  1c 00 = CubicEaseInterpolator (typeKey=28), no props (ease-in-out defaults)
  1f 37 07 "falling" = LinearAnimation (typeKey=31) name="falling" dur=360 loop=1

Binary confirmed correct via exhaustive analysis:
- LinearAnimation typeKey=31 ✓, objectIds 7/11/15/19/23 ✓, 16 tracks ✓, 99 objects ✓

